{"id":"45ad3c4764af1fc0","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lexicographic-extension.md","title":"df-lexicographic-extension","display":"df-lexicographic-extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-lexicographic-extension","aliases":["56-df-lexicographic-extension"],"display":"df-lexicographic-extension","depends_on":["[[56-df-multiset-extension]]"],"source_section":"A.1.17–A.1.20; 6.4.2","source_pages":"796–797; 211","source_ocr_blocks":[817,818,232],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lexicographic-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lexicographic-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lexicographic-extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"A.1.17–A.1.20; 6.4.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"796–797; 211"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>817</span><span>818</span><span>232</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq A^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\">\\(A^n\\)</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 为定义域的元组集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\">\\(\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 上的双射集。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^n\">\\(\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_n\">\\(\\mu_n\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^n\">\\(A^n\\)</span>，值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_f(A)\">\\(\\mathcal M_f(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_f(A)\">\\(\\mathcal M_f(A)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\">\\(Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Stat}_n&amp;:=\\{0\\}\\cup\\bigl(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu_n(\\vec a)(x)&amp;:=|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid a_i=x\\}|,\\\\\n\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\n&amp;\\iff\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(a_{\\pi(k)}Qb_{\\pi(k)}\\land\n\\forall j\\in[k-1]\\;a_{\\pi(j)}=b_{\\pi(j)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,0)\n&amp;:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\mu_n(\\vec a)Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\mu_n(\\vec b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,(1,\\pi))\n&amp;:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Stat}_n&amp;:=\\{0\\}\\cup\\bigl(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu_n(\\vec a)(x)&amp;:=|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid a_i=x\\}|,\\\\\n\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\n&amp;\\iff\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(a_{\\pi(k)}Qb_{\\pi(k)}\\land\n\\forall j\\in[k-1]\\;a_{\\pi(j)}=b_{\\pi(j)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,0)\n&amp;:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\mu_n(\\vec a)Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\mu_n(\\vec b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,(1,\\pi))\n&amp;:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Definition A.1.17 的定长字典序提升及 Definition 6.4.2 的 status 的显式编码。编码 0 表示多重集，(1,π) 表示按排列 π 的优先次序。对 n=0 两种提升均为空关系；对 n=1 二者都等于基关系。原书 Lemma A.1.18 只在固定长度上保良基，不能据此对任意长有限序列的字典序宣称保良基。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；A.1.17–A.1.20; 6.4.2，印刷页 796–797; 211。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-multiset-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A$ 为集合，$Q\\subseteq A^2$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。$A^n$ 表示以 $[n]$ 为定义域的元组集，$\\mathrm{Sym}([n])$ 为 $[n]$ 上的双射集。取 $\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^n$、$x\\in A$、$\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([n])$；$\\mu_n$ 的定义域为 $A^n$，值域为 $\\mathcal M_f(A)$。$\\mathcal M_f(A)$ 和 $Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 见 [[56-df-multiset-extension]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A^n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sym}([n])","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a,\\vec b\\in A^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([n])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_n","display":false},{"tex":"A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_f(A)","display":false},{"tex":"Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Stat}_n&:=\\{0\\}\\cup\\bigl(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Sym}([n])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu_n(\\vec a)(x)&:=|\\{i\\in[n]\\mid a_i=x\\}|,\\\\\n\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\n&\\iff\\exists k\\in[n]\\;(a_{\\pi(k)}Qb_{\\pi(k)}\\land\n\\forall j\\in[k-1]\\;a_{\\pi(j)}=b_{\\pi(j)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,0)\n&:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\mu_n(\\vec a)Q^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\mu_n(\\vec b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Lift}_{A,n}(Q,(1,\\pi))\n&:=\\{(\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in(A^n)^2\\mid\\vec a\\;Q^{\\mathrm{lex},\\pi}\\;\\vec b\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2024,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e0ceb35e6a34f4f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,\\succ$。为每个 $f\\in F$ 选择 $\\pi_f\\in\\mathrm{Sym}([\\mathrm{ar}(f)])$；$\\mathrm{Stat}_n$ 的编码见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。"},{"id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；$\\succ\\subseteq F^2$ 满足 $\\mathrm{StrictOrder}(F,\\succ)$。取 $\\tau\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}\\mathrm{Stat}_{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$、$Q\\subseteq T^2$、$s,t\\in T$。$|t|$ 为 [[56-df-size]] 的有限项大小；$s=f(\\vec s)$ 表示 $f\\in F$、$\\vec s\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}(f)}$，同样使用 $t=g(\\vec t)$。$\\mathrm{Lift}$ 见 [[56-df-lexicographic-extension]]。以下 $\\Phi(Q)$ 的内部递归按 $|s|+|t|$ 作良基递归，$Q$ 只作为 status 提升的已给定关系；$>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}$ 的所有参数为 $(\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau)$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-209","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lexicographic-extension.md]]"}],"outgoing":["943afdb3e6462a3a"]}